 $CA31 DEFB $FE,$00,$38,$00,$42,$00,$3D,$01 ; src="images/sprites/spriteCA29.png"
 $CA39 DEFB $01,$03,$01,$1F,$05,$0F,$0D,$07 ; />] Plane shift 0
